<title>USA: Offshore Energy files 3.182 mln offering.</title>
<headline>Offshore Energy files 3.182 mln offering.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Offshore Energy Development Corp said on Monday that it has filed a Securities and Exchange Commission registration statement to offer 3,182,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it would offer three million shares and certain shareholders would offer 182,000 shares.</p>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co Inc and Principal Financial Securities Inc are the underwriters, Offshore said.</p>
</text>
